er\\tshare\\t—\\tDiluted |  |  |  |\n| Income\\tfrom\\tcontinuing\\toperations,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | $2.79 | $2.33 | $0.85 |\n| Net\\tincome | $2.81 | $2.33 | $0.85 |\n| Dividends\\tdeclared\\tand\\tpaid\\tper\\tshare | $0.94 | $0.84 | $0.80 |\n| (1)\\tIncludes\\tstock-based\\tcompensation\\texpense\\tas\\tfollows: |  |  |  |\n| Cost\\tof\\tsales | $7,294 | $7,333 | $7,469 |\n| Research\\tand\\tdevelopment | $23,289 | $23,342 | $22,666 |\n| Selling,\\tmarketing,\\tgeneral\\tand\\tadministrative | $21,775 | $21,077 | $18,478 |\n\nSee\taccompanying\tNotes.\n\n# CONSOLIDATED\tBALANCE\tSHEETS\n\n| (thousands,\texcept\tper\tshare\tamounts) | 2011 | 2010 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| ASSETS |  |  |\n| Current\\tAssets |  |  |\n| Cash\\tand\\tcash\\tequivalents | $1,405,100 | $1,070,000 |\n| Short-term\\tinvestments | 2,187,362 | 1,617,768 |\n| Accounts\\treceivable\\tless\\tallowances\\tof\\t$1,465\\t($1,581\\tin\\t2010) | 348,416 | 387,169 |\n| Inventories(1) | 295,081 | 277,478 |\n| Deferred\\ttax\\tassets | 82,171 | 74,710 |\n| Prepaid\\tincome\\ttax | 22,002 | — |\n| Prepaid\\texpenses\\tand\\tother\\tcurrent\\tassets | 46,216 | 51,874 |\n| Total\\tcurrent\\tassets | 4,386,348 | 3,478,999 |\n| Property,\\tPlant\\tand\\tEquipment,\\tat\\tCost |  |  |\n| Land\\tand\\tbuildings | 430,453 | 401,277 |\n| Machinery\\tand\\tequipment | 1,606,150 | 1,578,493 |\n| Office\\tequipment | 51,960 | 56,449 |\n| Leasehold\\timprovements | 48,338 | 65,326 |\n|  | 2,136,901 | 2,101,545 |\n| Less\\taccumulated\\tdepreciation\\tand\\tamortization | 1,658,062 | 1,628,880 |\n| Net\\tproperty,\\tplant\\tand\\tequipment | 478,839 | 472,665 |\n| Other\\tAssets |  |  |\n| Deferred\\tcompensation\\tplan\\tinvestments | 26,410 | 8,690 |\n| Other\\tinvestments | 2,951 | 1,317 |\n| Goodwill | 275,087 | 255,580 |\n| Intangible\\tassets,\\tnet | 12,200 | 1,343 |\n| Deferred\\ttax\\tassets | 37,645 | 52,765 |\n| Other\\tassets | 58,155 | 57,472 |\n| Total\\tother\\tassets | 412,448 | 377,167 |\n|  | $5,